# Dedicated, unprivileged service user for the LES11-MC-Dx over-temp monitor.
# Created declaratively by systemd-sysusers (idempotent; no manual useradd).
# UID auto-assigned, no login shell, home set to a non-existent path.
u les11-monitor - "LES11-MC-Dx over-temperature shutdown monitor" /nonexistent -
